# Spreadsheets are zip containers: never apply end-of-line conversion to them.
# core.autocrlf is true on this machine and there was no .gitattributes, so git
# classified *.xlsx as "text: unspecified" and relied on content sniffing alone.
*.xlsx binary
*.xlsm binary
*.xls  binary

# Committed geodata and bundles are binary too.
*.geojson -text
*.bundle  binary
*.parquet binary
